Fixed all six findings:

- Added `BenchError::SizeTooLarge` with truthful sizing text; budget messages now keep sub-second precision.
- Added `run_cli_with_path`; tests cover the no-argument baseline write and write-failure path.
- `run_all` now shares one deadline across all four workloads.
- Added per-workload max-size boundary tests; capped Fibonacci at 78 where `f64` is exact.
- Extended `DELIVERY_REASON` and the in-flight comment to name phase-073’s files.
- `WrongAnswer` now renders expected text the same way as the actual value.

Gates all pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy -D warnings`, `cargo test` (2683 passed), and `verify.sh phase-073` (`VERIFY PASS`).
